(global_label "IMU_CLKIN_MON" (shape bidirectional) (at 370.84 367.03 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d18965a2-c6ce-5f7e-97b3-9f5311003f39") (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 370.84 367.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)))
(text "IMU BLOCK (Rev 11.0)\n- ICM-42688-P pinout: TDK DS-000347 rev 1.2 sec 4.1 (LCSC C1850418). RESV 7 -> GND (datasheet:\n  'Connect to GND'); RESV 2/3/10/11 'No Connect or Connect to GND' -> NC.\n- CLKIN: datasheet range 31-50 kHz (typ 32). RTC_MODE = INTF_CONFIG1 (bank0 0x4D) bit2,\n  PIN9_FUNCTION = INTF_CONFIG5 (bank1 0x7B) bits[2:1] = 0b10. ODR scales f_CLKIN/32 kHz\n  (8 kHz -> 8192 Hz). Dead Y2 stalls BOTH IMUs: firmware must watch IMU_CLKIN_MON (PD12)\n  and fall back to the internal oscillator (RTC_MODE=0).\n- Supply filter per IMU: FB (600R@100MHz) + 22R + 10uF, 100nF at VDD and at VDDIO.\n  Datasheet sec 4.2 reference: VDD 0.1uF + 2.2uF, VDDIO 10nF.\nLAYOUT RULES\n- R10-R12 / R19-R21 within 3 mm of U1; R18 / R22 within 3 mm of the IMU SDO pin.\n- R14/R15/R16 at Y2 (star); C18/C19 (C21/C22) within 1 mm of IMU pins 8/5.\n- No ESC switch-node copper or motor return current under U2/U3/Y2.\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 431.8 252.73 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "255d2a91-cec5-5fc0-9212-88ec009c190e"))
(text "DPS310 barometer on I2C1 400 kHz (Rev 12.0)\nI2C mode: CSB -> VDDIO, SDO -> GND => addr 0x76" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 444.5 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ccca237c-fac0-52cf-b708-d910f2b1c5a5"))
