(text "BARO BLOCK (Rev 12.0)\n- U4 DPS310 pinout: LCSC C130156 / Infineon DS v01_02: 1 GND, 2 CSB, 3 SDI, 4 SCK, 5 SDO, 6 VDDIO, 7 GND, 8 VDD.\n  CSB tied to VDDIO selects I2C; SDO to GND = 0x76 = hwdef 'BARO DPS310 I2C:0:0x76'.\n- I2C1 PB6 SCL / PB7 SDA, 400 kHz Fm. The ONLY on-board pull-ups on I2C1 are R23/R24 2.2k; the\n  GPS/compass module must not add strong pull-ups: combined Rp >= 1022R for 3 mA at VOL 0.4 V with\n  VDD max 3.465 V => module pull-up >= 1.91k (none/4k7/10k OK; 4k7 module -> E3 window 1305..4321 R).\n  2.2k meets Fm tr <= 300 ns (0.8473*Rp*Cb) up to Cb = 161 pF incl. the GPS/compass cable.\n- Supply: FB4 + C24 1uF + C25 100nF (VDD) + C26 100nF (VDDIO); DS reference 100 nF per supply pin.\nLAYOUT RULES\n- U4 on the face/corner farthest from ESC switch nodes and hot FETs: >= 5 mm from any phase node or\n  MOSFET copper, no motor/battery current under U4 on any layer; not next to the LDO/regulators.\n- Keep-out under U4: no vias, no traces on the U4 layer between pads, solid GND on the adjacent plane.\n- Shield U4 from light (opaque foam/cover); vent hole of U4 faces into the foam chamber.\n- Vent position and keep-out must match the acoustic foam chamber in cad/ (open-cell foam over U4,\n  no direct prop-wash path; chamber vent away from the FC fan/airflow).\n- I2C1 SCL/SDA routed on a layer referenced to In1/In4 GND, adjacent pair, no plane splits;\n  R25/R26 within 2 mm of U4 pins 4/3, R23/R24 within 3 mm of U1 pins 92/93.\n- C25/C26 within 1 mm of U4 pins 8/6; GND pins 1/7 straight to a GND via.\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 444.5 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bc18c25a-a250-530f-b7ea-84110b65621b"))
