(label "+3V3_BARO" (at 426.72 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "46787bf9-1948-5f20-b2af-978df0eea31e"))
(text "HSE DESIGN (analysis/hse_vdda_analysis.py, report analysis/hse_vdda_report.json)\n- 24 MHz chosen so ArduPilot can run 480 MHz: PLL1 24/M3=8 MHz ref, xN120 = 960 MHz VCO, /P2 = 480 MHz SYSCLK.\n  25 MHz cannot: stm32h7_mcuconf.h has no 480 MHz PLL set for 25 MHz (#error). PLL3: 24/6x72/6 = 48 MHz USB.\n- CL = C1*C2/(C1+C2) + Cstray = 8 pF + ~4 pF = 12.0 pF = spec -> 0 ppm nominal, +24/-20 ppm worst corner (C1m 8 fF).\n- gm_crit = 4*ESR*(2*pi*f)^2*(C0+CL)^2 = 0.94 mA/V worst corner (ESR 30R, C0 5pF) -> x1.59 vs Gm_critmax 1.5 mA/V.\n  Substitutes need ESR_max <= 40R at CL 12 pF, <= 20R at CL 20 pF (x1.2 margin). R1 never above 6R8.\nLAYOUT RULES\n- Y1, C1, C2 within 5 mm of pins 12/13, same layer as U1, no vias in OSC traces, OSC traces < 0.1 mm wide-match.\n- Solid GND guard ring around Y1/C1/C2 stitched to In1 GND every 1 mm; no other signals under Y1 on In1.\n- C1/C2 GND returns to one GND island tied to VSS pin 10 - do NOT route ESC/motor return currents under it.\n- FB1 + R2 at the +3V3 entry; C3/C4 within 1 mm of pin 21, C5/C6 within 1 mm of pin 20; VSSA pin 19 via\n  directly into the analog GND region of In1 (single solid plane, no split).\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 282 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "868b5f3f-92c9-58fc-9e57-c8f1a445d580"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
